Found it. When the loop body is a single statement without braces, node.body is that statement, not a BlockStatement, so node.body.body is undefined. Guard it:
```ts
const stmts = node.body.type === 'BlockStatement' ? node.body.body : [node.body];
checkBody(stmts);
```
